

DJ | PRODUCTOR

DIROS is a DJ and producer from Barcelona in 
constant evolution, with a solid background and 
a deep knowledge of electronic music. His 
versatile and dynamic approach allows him to 
fuse different styles into immersive sets, 
designed to precisely adapt to the context and 
energy of each dance floor.
His sound moves between Minimal Deep Tech, 
Minimal and Tech House, shaping a current,
dancefloor-ready musical proposal of high artistic 
quality. Thanks to his track reading ability and his
sound identity, DIROS consolidates himself as an 
artist to watch within the electronic scene.
